    "updated_at": "2016-02-08T19:13:03Z",
    "body": "Commit message should be in present tense, so e.g. \"Replace sniffed MIME type with computed MIME type\".\n\nAlso things after the title should be phrased as sentences, so e.g. \"Fixes https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28100.\" (with a period) and a period at the end of the second sentence too.\n",
